OL,3,GNEWSAControversial housing development
OL,4,Adelayed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on a Kent housing estate has
OL,7,Fbeen delayed again over ecological
OL,8,Fconcerns.
OL,10,FTonbridge & Malling Borough Council
OL,11,Finitially granted permission for 65
OL,12,Fhomes on land owned by the Ministry of
OL,13,FDefence, south of Discovery Drive in
OL,14,FKings Hill in 2024.
OL,16,FHowever, at a planning committee
OL,17,Fmeeting last week, it voted unanimously
OL,18,Fto again defer the application.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
