OL,3,GNEWSAControversial housing development
OL,4,Adelayed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors asked planning officers to
OL,7,Fwork with the developer to redraw the
OL,8,Fdevelopment's boundaries to exclude an
OL,9,Farea that may contain ancient woodland
OL,10,Fand include a buffer zone.
